control: The latest authentication attempt is recorded at the end of every unit of work, a failed one included, and a failed recording ends the pass in an error
removes: only an attempt that succeeded is recorded, so a refused or failed one never reaches the account's state row
packages: ./backfill/app
tests: TestARunRecordsEachAccountsAttemptWhenItsUnitEnds TestOnlyALaterAttemptIsRecorded TestAFailedRecordingIsReturned
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

